. You have to point and shoot the correct answer with Gear Vr Controller in the shortest possible time. And make no mistake or you will get an electric shock!. It's fun and highly recommended for teachers to encourage their students with Math and Music. Gear Vr Controller required.", "short_description": "An educational app to learn multiplication tables and the name of notes on the staff. Also, there are extra levels for ear training and a musical memory game. \n     You have to  point and shoot the correct answer with Gear Vr Controller in the shortest possible time. And make no mistake or you will get an electric shock!. It's fun and highly recommended for teachers to encourage their students with Math and Music. Gear Vr Controller required."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://termsfeed.com/privacy-policy/97bbd061665a34feeb770c2e5a014223", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://termsfeed.com/privacy-policy/97bbd061665a34feeb770c2e5a014223", "publisher_name": "Rafael Gimeno", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqdPBw7LqObII7qDh6pUwpg", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "MUSIC"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1090840135045391"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410487_1802833909770062_5333006164969914368_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gchfHHhcvrMQ7kNvwGHi7wz&_nc_oc=AdldaP